@startuml
title UML - durable Finance audit progress and native receipt recovery
participant "Finance domain command" as Domain
database "Finance immutable source / cursor / attempts" as Finance
control "Worker audit relay" as Relay
participant "Controls AuditLog" as Controls
database "Native Controls audit events / chain" as Native
actor "Finance operator" as Operator
Domain -> Finance : Commit original ID / actor / occurrence time / payload
Relay -> Finance : Next <= 50 undelivered IDs after cursor
loop Bounded pass; per-event timeout
 Relay -> Finance : Commit cursor at current attempted identity
 Relay -> Relay : Validate exact original record / representation
 alt Invalid or noncanonical original
  Relay -> Finance : Retain safe failure attempt; keep original pending
 else Valid original
  Relay -> Finance : Native confirmation inquiry by original ID
  Finance -> Native : Verify ID / finance stream / exact payload / native digest
  alt Original native event already accepted
   Finance -> Finance : Atomic immutable receipt + delivery acknowledgment
  else Native receipt not observed
   Relay -> Controls : Append original ID / stream / exact payload
   Controls -> Native : Idempotent append; stream lock / original chain
   Native --> Controls : Original accepted digest or unknown transport outcome
   Relay -> Finance : Independent native confirmation inquiry
   Finance -> Native : Verify original scope and digest; never trust caller flag
   opt Original event confirmed
    Finance -> Finance : Immutable receipt + acknowledgment in one transaction
   end
  end
  Relay -> Finance : Retain safe attempt; original source digest
 end
end
Relay -> Finance : Empty page resets cursor; failures retried after wrap
Operator -> Finance : Workforce GET list / saved event URL
Finance -> Native : Verify receipt against original native event
Finance --> Operator : Safe IDs / codes / digest / native receipt; no raw payload
note over Domain,Native
A failed or uncertain audit attempt does not determine financial outcome.
No original record is deleted, rewritten or marked delivered without native evidence.
No transaction spans Controls append and Finance acknowledgment.
end note
@enduml
